Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 06:59:50 +0800
Subject: dt-bindings: watchdog: arm,sp805: reference the PrimeCell binding

The SP805 binding ends in unevaluatedProperties: false but, unlike the
other PrimeCell bindings, never references /schemas/arm/primecell.yaml#,
so arm,primecell-periphid -- the override for the hardware ID value --
cannot be described on an SP805 node.
That override is not optional on hardware that needs it: an SP805 whose
ID header is absent never gets past amba_match() without it and no
watchdog exists, and the existing hix5hd2 board file already carries the
property for this reason.
Add the reference.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)


diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/arm,sp805.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/arm,sp805.yaml
index bd7c09ed1938..690456839fcc 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/arm,sp805.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/arm,sp805.yaml
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ description: |+
 
 allOf:
   - $ref: /schemas/watchdog/watchdog.yaml#
+  - $ref: /schemas/arm/primecell.yaml#
 
 # Need a custom select here or 'arm,primecell' will match on lots of nodes
 select:
